  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Finally! Did you take a nap on the way, or are you just naturally this
      slow? My time is literally money!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Sorry! I was just taking my time and enjoying the breeze.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Must be nice to have time for "breezes." Some of us have bills to pay and
      customers to satisfy!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: A little fresh air never hurt anyone, Lan. You should try it.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "I\u2019ll breathe when I\u2019m rich. Now take this! Ok, so I will just
      give you the parcel, deliver it safe and sound for me, take care!"
    Choices: []
